      "candle_flowers": "Lamp structure remains but color/brightness shifts in the motion-guided outputs; learned correction further changes the initially accurate static scene."
    },
    "interpretation": "Artifact presence in geometry-only arm rules out blaming the CNN alone. Incompatible warped/mixed endpoint priors and missing visibility/phase modeling are hypotheses, not isolated causal proofs.",
